Subject: [PATCH] MD3 Expressive: fase 3 (pastas grandes, novas formas)

---
 MD3_EXPRESSIVE_README.md                      |  5 +++++
 res/values-pt-rBR/lineage_strings.xml         |  5 +++++
 res/values/strings.xml                        |  5 +++++
 .../launcher3/folder/FolderGridOrganizer.java |  6 ++++--
 .../launcher3/popup/PopupDataSource.kt        |  2 +-
